From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:25:00 +0300
Subject: debian: build profile pkg.wesnoth.archonly

Builds only the two architecture-dependent packages, wesnoth-1.18 and
wesnoth-1.18-server, for a port that takes the arch-all packages (data,
campaigns, music, tools) from the archive: those are excluded with
Build-Profiles, and the dependencies of the two on them ask for the archive's
version (wesnoth:Data-Version, ours without +ps3) instead of
${source:Version}.

